Enjoy hundreds of anime titles from the comfort of your PS5/PS4 consoles
(For Southeast Asia) Crunchyroll Arrives for PS5 and PS4 users in Indonesia, Malaysia and Thailand
We are excited to share that Crunchyroll , the global and ultimate destination for anime fandom, has arrived for PlayStation 5 and PlayStation 4 users in Indonesia, Malaysia and Thailand. Anime fans can now subscribe to Crunchyroll directly through PlayStation Media Hub on PS5 or PS4.&nbsp;
Crunchyroll offers hundreds of anime titles, including Black Clover Season 2 and Overgeared .&nbsp;
The Crunchyroll Mega Fan membership is now available through PlayStation Store on PS5 or PS4 for IDR 49,000 / MYR 14.90 / THB 119 per month. It includes ad-free viewing, offline downloads on supported devices, streaming on up to four devices simultaneously, and access to Crunchyroll Game Vault, a collection of over 100 anime-inspired mobile games included with the membership.&nbsp;
Please be kind, considerate, and constructive. Report inappropriate comments to PlayStationBlogModeration@sony.com
